title: "Enable Authority Discovery on Asset Hub Westend, People-Westend and YAP"

doc:
  - audience: Node Operator
    description: |
      Enables the collator authority-discovery on the following parachains:
      Westend AH, Westend PC and YAP.

      **After the runtime upgrade, every collator on Westend AH and Westend PC
      MUST submit a `session.set_keys` extrinsic carrying their
      authority-discovery key.**

      Until you rotate, your collator stays at its current connectivity but is
      not part of the AD mesh.

      How to tell if a collator has rotated: query `session.nextKeys(<account>)`.
      Until rotated, the `authority_discovery` field carries a deterministic
      hashed placeholder (`blake2_256(aura_bytes)`).

crates:
  - name: parachains-common
    bump: minor
  - name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: people-westend-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: yet-another-parachain-runtime
    bump: major
